But they were actually receiving the money&nbsp;
from the spending bill, not the covid bill,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:47.120
but they were passed together. Reminder&nbsp;
of that from Donald Trump's Tuesday video.&nbsp;

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:52.800
This bill contains eighty five point five&nbsp;
dollars million for assistance to Cambodia.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:59.680
One hundred and thirty four million dollars to&nbsp;
Burma, one point three billion dollars for Egypt&nbsp;&nbsp;

